{"unit_id":"giiiiiithub__terminal#card-zh","repo":"giiiiiithub/terminal","commit":"c6d0fbfc45f6fc5ccfb4a60c4a1d400ebd177e24","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-terminal 是面向 DSH Web UI 的终端面板插件，在会话标题栏提供打开入口，并把终端面板接入输入区停靠栏。它通过宿主端 node-pty 启动真实 shell，再由浏览器端 xterm.js 呈现，并使用 term Remote 在两端传递终端数据。用户可以选择可用 shell、创建多个终端会话、输入命令并查看输出，也能调整终端尺寸和结束会话。适合需要在 DSH 网页会话中直接运行本机命令行工具的开发者。运行需要 Node.js 20 或更高版本、node-pty 原生模块和宿主机可用的 shell；插件不要求额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:20-91","src/index.ts:217-263","src/client/api.ts:85-119"]}
{"unit_id":"giiiiiithub__terminal#card-en","repo":"giiiiiithub/terminal","commit":"c6d0fbfc45f6fc5ccfb4a60c4a1d400ebd177e24","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-terminal adds a real shell panel to the DSH Web UI. The host starts PTY sessions with node-pty, rendered in the browser with xterm.js. Users can select a shell, enter commands, read output, resize and end sessions. Requires Node.js 20+, node-pty and a host shell; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:20-91","src/index.ts:217-263","src/client/api.ts:85-119"]}
